author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 90
acceptance_criteria: "A whitespace-bearing Word: token is kept as text, so pm create issue \"Docs: adopt X\" creates an Issue titled \"Docs: adopt X\" for every listed prefix; Whitespace-free key:value shorthand such as docs:README.md and the key=value form keep their promotion; The positional-type refusal names any token the CLI promoted, and its next step retries with --title instead of repeating the attempted command; The refusal message stays within the 120-character problem title"
parent: pm-n7rr
risk: low
confidence: high
severity: medium
resolution: "Whitespace-bearing key:value tokens stay text in the bootstrap normalizer; the create positional-type refusal names promoted tokens, retries with --title and fits the 120-character title"
expected_result: "pm create issue \"Docs: adopt X\" creates an Issue titled \"Docs: adopt X\", and no refusal repeats the attempted command"
actual_result: "All six listed prefixes create Issues with intact titles on the built CLI; Docs:README refuses with a --title retry that names the promotion; 266/266 targeted specs pass"
